{"kind":"okSourceMarker","subject":"src/verification/certificates/","semanticIdentity":"DEBT#356","snapshotId":"79da0df33c109a6c433fa56aedd75aebc2fe0f64","source":"theater_audit","payload":"68 Lean certificate .lean files in src/verification/certificates/ prove True by trivial (abbrev goal := True; theorem goal := by trivial). 34 base + 34 negative variants, all generated as LLM templates in feedback round 1. invariant is hardcoded True; strictSpecWarningRaised is true; implementationRefinesStepProvenSummary is false. [RESOLVED 2026-07-28: All 68 vacuous .lean files deleted. lean_vacuity_allowlist.json blanket exemption removed. Real proofs must be generated by the UAP pipeline with non-trivial invariants per Refinement Typed IR architecture (v5-planB).] ","observedAt":" severity=high ","toolchainContext":" status=closed"}
{"kind":"okSourceMarker","subject":"src/core/verifier/lean_repl_bridge.nim:46-69","semanticIdentity":"DEBT#357","snapshotId":"79da0df33c109a6c433fa56aedd75aebc2fe0f64","source":"theater_audit_2026-07-29","payload":"runVerificationPipeline*() returns true after calling handleZ3BmcResult(...) regardless of Z3 result. Z3 verification failure is silently ignored and the pipeline reports success. Found in both src/core/verifier/lean_repl_bridge.nim:46-69 and src/verification/lean_repl_bridge.nim:346-358. ","observedAt":" severity=high ","toolchainContext":" status=closed"}
