{"kind":"okSourceMarker","subject":"src/core/proof/proof_vacuity_gate.nim:242-250","semanticIdentity":"DEBT#362","snapshotId":"79da0df33c109a6c433fa56aedd75aebc2fe0f64","source":"theater_audit_2026-07-29","payload":"verifyNonTrivialityWithFallback returns (true, false, '') when no security constraints exist, and (true, true, 'z3_timeout_or_error') on Z3 timeout/error. This fallback-to-trivial path allows vacuous proofs to pass. Also, sourceHasAxiomPurePragma can mute vacuity warnings via pragma exemption. ","observedAt":" severity=high ","toolchainContext":" status=closed"}
